/P 102 0 R
/E (Dorian may be the most common mode in current popular music. You can hear it in filmscores, Coltrane solos, folk celtic music, Ravel, Bartok, Paul McCartney and more. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (One good way to remember the Dorian mode is to think of a NATURAL MINOR SCALE WITH A RAISED 6th. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3 5 4]
>>
